# --------------------------------------------------
# Local Codex / Project Documentation
# --------------------------------------------------
# Keep all Markdown documentation local.
# This includes AGENTS.md files and documentation
# under docs/, backend/, web/, mobile/, infrastructure,
# services/, and any future subdirectories.
**/*.md

# README.md in the repository root is the ONLY
# Markdown file that should be committed.
!/README.md